en=\"true\">05</span>Hit the buzzer</li></ol>\n        <p class=\"hndrd-ed__finish\">Clear the court. Earn the next round.</p>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hndrd-ed__stats\" aria-label=\"Event format\"><div class=\"hndrd-ed__stat\"><strong>40</strong><span>Players<br>at the start</span></div><div class=\"hndrd-ed__stat\"><strong>05</strong><span>Courts<br>to conquer</span></div><div class=\"hndrd-ed__stat\"><strong>05</strong><span>Finalists<br>at the finish</span></div></div>\n    <dl class=\"hndrd-ed__details\"><div><dt>Date</dt><dd>25 Sept 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Venue</dt><dd>LSBI Badminton Arena,<br>New Kalyani Nagar, Pune</dd></div><div><dt>Reporting</dt><dd>4:00 PM</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>2 hours</dd></div><div><dt>Entry fee</dt><dd class=\"hndrd-ed__price\">₹199</dd></div></dl>\n  </div>\n</section>",
